  "description": "Shenora core: desktop application host and builder (ShenoraApplication.CreateBuilder), lifecycle, module registration (IShenoraModule), environment and app-path services, event bus, and the platform-neutral shell contracts — the IUiDispatcher UI-thread seam plus file dialogs, clipboard, URL launching and UI blocking — so application logic compiles without a Windows reference. Depends on Microsoft.Extensions DI (implementation) + logging abstractions.",
